cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SchemaRouter, please cite the software using the metadata below; cite specific research findings with their primary evidence."
type: software
title: "SchemaRouter"
abstract: >-
  Typed capability routing and governed execution for AI agents across APIs,
  tools, and data systems. SchemaRouter compiles heterogeneous capability
  schemas into a bounded retrieval and validated execution boundary; it is
  not a general-purpose agent framework or a model router.
authors:
